        98.28800201416016
      ],
      "text": "Isoniazid preventive therapy",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        107.823486328125,
        216.7834014892578,
        121.45098876953125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 21  n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        131.5780029296875,
        513.2954711914062,
        146.91200256347656
      ],
      "text": "Children <5 years of age who are household or close contacts of people with",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        144.77801513671875,
        513.2734375,
        160.1120147705078
      ],
      "text": "TB and who, after an appropriate evaluation, are found not to have TB disease",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        157.97802734375,
        510.22650146484375,
        173.31202697753906
      ],
      "text": "should be given 6 months of IPT (10 mg/kg per day, range 7-15mg/kg, maxi-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        171.17803955078125,
        224.6883544921875,
        186.5120391845703
      ],
      "text": "mum dose 300 mg/day)",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        196.69952392578125,
        351.6803894042969,
        210.051025390625
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        221.43600463867188,
        510.2310485839844,
        234.85650634765625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for investigating contacts of persons with infectious tu- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        235.23599243164062,
        510.2309875488281,
        248.656494140625
      ],
      "text": "berculosis in low- and middle-income countries.  Geneva, World Health Organiza-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        249.10498046875,
        270.99639892578125,
        262.45648193359375
      ],
      "text": "tion, 2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.9)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        271.1044921875,
        513.3702392578125,
        284.45599365234375
      ],
      "text": "Preventive therapy is indicated for an asymptomatic contact or a contact in whom TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        287.10101318359375,
        513.347412109375,
        300.4525146484375
      ],
      "text": "disease has been excluded if the contact is less than 5 years of age or who is living",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        303.0975341796875,
        513.3934326171875,
        316.44903564453125
      ],
      "text": "with HIV (regardless of age). Preventive therapy for young children with TB infection",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        319.09405517578125,
        513.4281005859375,
        332.445556640625
      ],
      "text": "who have not yet developed TB disease will greatly reduce the likelihood of TB disease",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        335.02154541015625,
        251.22787475585938,
        348.4420471191406
      ],
      "text": "(18) developing during childhood .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        359.5970458984375,
        513.4622802734375,
        372.94854736328125
      ],
      "text": "While this treatment is called “preventive therapy”, it is actually treatment for latent",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        375.5935363769531,
        510.2080383300781,
        388.9450378417969
      ],
      "text": "TB infection. The preventive therapy regimen usually recommended is isoniazid 10 mg/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        391.59002685546875,
        513.4854125976562,
        404.9415283203125
      ],
      "text": "kg (7-15 mg/kg) daily for 6 months, hence the name isoniazid preventive therapy (IPT).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        407.5865173339844,
        513.4280395507812,
        420.9380187988281
      ],
      "text": "Single isoniazid dispersible tablets, 100 mg, can be obtained from the Global Drug",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        423.5140075683594,
        173.8444366455078,
        436.93450927734375
      ],
      "text": "(19) Facility (GDF)  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        448.0895080566406,
        513.4163818359375,
        461.4410095214844
      ],
      "text": "Follow-up should be carried out at least every 2 months until treatment is complete.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        464.08599853515625,
        513.3704223632812,
        477.4375
      ],
      "text": "There is no risk of isoniazid resistance developing in children receiving IPT, even if the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        480.01348876953125,
        297.86041259765625,
        493.4339904785156
      ],
      "text": "(20, 21,22) diagnosis of active TB is missed .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        506.27178955078125,
        380.4553527832031,
        522.9998168945312
      ],
      "text": "Suspected HIV infection of source case and contact",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        530.0112915039062,
        513.4144897460938,
        543.36279296875
      ],
      "text": "In settings of high HIV prevalence, TB contact investigations can be an important",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        546.0078125,
        513.41455078125,
        559.3593139648438
      ],
      "text": "opportunity to screen for both TB and HIV. It is always important to determine the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        562.0043334960938,
        513.483642578125,
        575.3558349609375
      ],
      "text": "HIV status of the source case and consider HIV counselling and testing for contacts. In",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        578.0007934570312,
        513.4259033203125,
        591.352294921875
      ],
      "text": "such settings, the child of a source case is at high risk of having HIV infection as well as",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        593.9283447265625,
        442.8849792480469,
        607.3488159179688
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis infection with  . Further details can be found in Chapter 6.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        621.0222778320312,
        213.58639526367188,
        634.6497802734375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 22 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        644.793701171875,
        513.2844848632812,
        660.127685546875
      ],
      "text": "In settings of high HIV prevalence, all household and close contacts of people",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        657.9937133789062,
        355.4783630371094,
        673.3276977539062
      ],
      "text": "with TB should be counselled and tested for HIV",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        683.5151977539062,
        370.8279113769531,
        696.86669921875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        708.2517700195312,
        510.2310485839844,
        721.6722412109375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for investigating contacts of persons with infectious tu- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        722.0517578125,
        510.2309875488281,
        735.4722290039062
      ],
      "text": "berculosis in low- and middle-income countries.  Geneva, World Health Organiza-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        735.9207153320312,
        270.99639892578125,
        749.272216796875
      ],
      "text": "tion, 2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.9)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
